## 4. Avoid diagnostic result leakage into conversation

The current frontend should distinguish natural conversational messages from actual diagnostic messages.

Greetings, everyday conversation, and conceptual questions should render as ordinary assistant replies with no irrelevant diagnostic trace or stale target panel.

Operational messages should retain the concise summary and optional expandable evidence that already fit the design.

